      "extract": "\\label{constant a(n)} In Section 3 we studied the behavior of $d_+[J_K(n)]$ under knot cabling for knots of period at most two. In this section we study knots with period greater than two under the additional hypothesis that, for $n \\gg 0$ we have $a(n)=a$, where $a$ is a constant. In this case, by abusing the terminology, we will say that $a(n)$ is constant. The main result in this section is the following.",
